# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supply-chain control files (must be committed)
#
# These negations are LAST on purpose: git applies the final matching rule, so
# they must come after the blanket `.npmrc` rule above.
#
# `pi install` runs npm lifecycle scripts with no `--ignore-scripts` on any
# code path (pi 0.84.1 src/core/package-manager.ts:1750, :1778, :1829), while
# Pi installs *itself* with `--ignore-scripts` (src/config.ts:174). The two
# re-included `.npmrc` files below are the controls that close that gap for
# the two npm scopes this repo owns. If either is swallowed by .gitignore it
# never reaches a clone and BOOT-01 ships as a no-op.
#
# Only these two ROOTED paths are re-included. Nested and user `.npmrc` files
# stay ignored because they can carry `_authToken` / `_auth` / `_password`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.pi/npm/*
.pi/git/
!/.npmrc
!/.pi/npm/.npmrc
